      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not make any changes to your medication without consulting your prescribing physician. Combining sertraline and tramadol can increase the risk of certain side effects, including serotonin syndrome, which is serious. You must discuss this potential interaction with your doctor before taking any new pain medication. They can advise you on safe alternatives or appropriate dosing.",
      "source": "target",
